Windows CI 35049955364 exposed the root cause of five voice installation/removal test failures: staged model files were reopened read-only before sync_all, while Windows FlushFileBuffers requires a writable handle. Reopen staged files with write access, preserving the existing verified publication and receipt order. Remove the unnecessary directory-specific std::fs rename fallback so the shared bounded Windows MoveFileEx path remains the single rename authority. Validation: voice download tests 36/36; cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings; cargo fmt --check; git diff --check; graphify update.
